      "Title": "Exam C2090-101 topic 1 question 35 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A large bank was planning to offload existing data from a data warehouse into Hadoop and use SQL queries to access historical data. Which one of the following statements is true for using HiveQL?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. It supports four logical operators in query predicates: IN, NOT IN, EXISTS, and NOT EXISTS"
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. It does not support nested sub-queries"
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. Hive supports all ANSI SQL 2011 syntax"
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. All of the above"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: A \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
